<p>
  {dgettext("help_space", "Every space also has a game room.")}
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "The game room already has arcade machines and tables to play, and everyone in the conversation can add more."
  )}
  {dgettext("help_space", "Only the people of the conversation can go in.")}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_community}>{dgettext("help_space", "Going in and out")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "The neon door stands on the central island of the End of Time, next to the wooden door of the office."
  )}
  {dgettext("help_space", "Walk up to the door and press E.")}
  {dgettext("help_space", "It asks if you want to enter.")}
  {dgettext("help_space", "Answer %{yes} to go in.", yes: dgettext("chat", "Yes"))}
  {dgettext("help_space", "The way out is the neon door next to where you arrive.")}
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "On a touch screen, the hand button of the on-screen controls does the same as E."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_community}>{dgettext("help_space", "What is already there")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "There are arcade machines, a pool table, a ping-pong table and computers with gaming chairs."
  )}
  {dgettext("help_space", "Press E next to an arcade machine to see which game it plays.")}
  {dgettext("help_space", "The other games are listed below it.")}
  {dgettext("help_space", "Watching opens in a tab of its own.")}
  {dgettext("help_space", "Press F next to a chair to sit down.")}
  {dgettext("help_space", "This furniture is part of the game room.")}
  {dgettext("help_space", "This furniture cannot be moved, turned or removed.")}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_community}>{dgettext("help_space", "Adding pieces")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "Press %{build} in the top-left corner, or B, to see the pieces.",
    build: dgettext("chat", "Build")
  )}
  {dgettext("help_space", "The Build menu opens on the %{tab} tab.",
    tab: dgettext("chat", "Gamer")
  )}
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "Any piece from the Construct can also be placed in the game room."
  )}
  {dgettext("help_space", "They are placed, moved and painted the same way.")}
  <.help_link topic="feature-space-construct">
    {dgettext("help_space", "The Construct")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_community}>{dgettext("help_space", "Together")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext("help_space", "Everyone inside sees each change at once.")}
  {dgettext("help_space", "The game room keeps everything that was added to it.")}
  {dgettext(
    "help_space",
    "Like the Construct, the game room is part of the space's gathering."
  )}
</p>
